   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/1223aaa2656dc5a4.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by Alexandru Micu/ZME Science)</figcaption>\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>The image shows a hormone made of different amino acids. Each amino acid making the hormone is color-coded and marked with three letters.</p>\n<p>Based on its size, what kind of hormone would this be?</p>",
